Things to keep in mind when choosing a niche - 
Look for niches with consistent content opportunities rather than short-lived trends.
Evaluate the monetization potential of each niche.
Consider potential revenue sources such as brand collaborations, affiliate marketing, sponsored posts and digital products.
Check the competition and identify opportunities to offer something different.
Make sure you can consistently create or source quality content for the niche.
Once you've selected a niche, focus on building your page around it rather than frequently switching topics.
